WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.679
Thank you for completing Renew.

00:00:01.679 --> 00:00:04.080
We hope you enjoyed it and got something out of it.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.480
Again, if you have any questions or comments, feel free to ask your counselor or just send

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.080
us an email at steplabillinois at gmail.com.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.919
It will be checked every morning, Monday through Friday.

00:00:14.919 --> 00:00:19.000
If you are feeling sad or angry or negative in any way, please let us know.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.440
If any of this stuff brought up thoughts like you want to hurt yourself in any way, please

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.480
contact one of the phone numbers below immediately.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:29.000
This can be done anonymously, which means someone won't know your name or where you

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.000
live.

